us","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}(G)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq V\\mid\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq I)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq V\\mid\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq I)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Appendix A.1.1 的 stable set/independent set。因为 Graph 只含二元素边，此式等价于原来逐对顶点的不相邻条件。输出是一族顶点子集，修去旧签名的层级问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,E)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Graph}(G)$（see [[27-df-graph]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq V\\mid\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq I)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1142,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-indset|df-indset — Independent-set fam